   "id": "iris-and-the-giant-121390@1.0.4",
   "gameId": "iris-and-the-giant-121390",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-03-03T20:54:33.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A small hotfix for the main problem you've reported. We will continue to investigate the other issues submited.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patchnotes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Game froze when using \"dance\" card, using stairs before using every sword in hand, power \"swordRegeneration\" is active, and a sword was in hand (either because it was there before using \"dance\" card or with the power who gives two swords on new floor)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chests now offer one more dagger card with the power allowing to throw daggers on second row (as stated in the description)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hydra no longer shows a flying head animation when hit by a stone",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug in Iris animation when using a burning healing card while having less than 8HP",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug with giant stones that made you able to restart a level as many times as you want if you had at least two of them",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug allowing you to have more than 4 giant stones",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug calling game over function twice, resulting in twice more rewards given",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Game stuck when using Lyre on closed pandora monster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Game stuck when using the card giving 6 swords in hand, killing a monster with a hourglass, then using every sword in hand",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "No game over nor giant help when the big trap ate your last cards from your hand: Thanks again for your support on our game and the reviews!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
